# own-infra ownership allowlist (operator-maintained)
#
# The own-infra preset grants testing authorization ONLY for hosts listed here.
# One entry per line; '#' starts a comment. Domain entries match the domain
# itself and every subdomain. IPv4 ranges use the cidr: prefix. IPv6 is not
# matched (stays pending).
#
# Rules of thumb:
#   - List only infrastructure your organization OWNS or OPERATES end-to-end
#     (your own VMs, your lab ranges, your registered domains).
#   - NEVER list vendor/SaaS control planes (cloud dashboards, PSP endpoints,
#     email/marketing platforms, shared hosting panels, code hosting). They
#     remain third parties even when they host your workloads.
#   - NEVER list third-party production systems of customers or partners.
#   - Anything not covered here stays auth.status=pending and needs explicit
#     owner authorization via --auth-granted --evidence-of-auth.

# ChefGroep-owned domains (add domains you own here; subdomains included)
chefgroep.online
chefgroep.nl

# ChefGroep Tailscale tailnet
tail86a8f2.ts.net

# Lab / private ranges
cidr:10.0.0.0/8
cidr:172.16.0.0/12
cidr:192.168.0.0/16
cidr:100.64.0.0/10
